{"3509160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BAIONLENJA", "steam_appid": 3509160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3758410], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BAIONLENJA: First-Person Adventure that focuses on Source-Engine Inspired Movement Physics.</strong> <br><br>B-HOP and <span class=\"bb_strike\">rocket</span> BLADE JUMP<br>The oldest movement exploits in FPS history are refined and polished to become your weapons. <br>Let's see an enemy survive a blade hit while you're going at MACH 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/14921cf9574c967f0b0ac1ab91627766.poster.avif?t=1787305316\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/14921cf9574c967f0b0ac1ab91627766.webm?t=1787305316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/14921cf9574c967f0b0ac1ab91627766.mp4?t=1787305316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Movement so powerful it looks like cheating, but it takes skill to master</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">New to Source-Engine movement?  <br>No problem, the game will guide you to become a movement pro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/27e6b025a1ed16f7abb831e9b606817d.poster.avif?t=1787305316\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/27e6b025a1ed16f7abb831e9b606817d.webm?t=1787305316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/27e6b025a1ed16f7abb831e9b606817d.mp4?t=1787305316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Deepest Lore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are SPIRIT: a being awakened by the god-like fossil creature GEHIRN who grants you physics-defying abilities and guides you towards an unknown purpose. <br>Enter the BAIONLENJA Corporation research facility where the fossil is being studied, and learn the truth of your origin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/e6b694765bf1ecf30b6a6c4fa0890132.poster.avif?t=1787305316\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/e6b694765bf1ecf30b6a6c4fa0890132.webm?t=1787305316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/e6b694765bf1ecf30b6a6c4fa0890132.mp4?t=1787305316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dripping with early 2000's style, runs on a potato</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Jam-packed with PS2 era music, graphics and sound design. Passion project of a Finnish solo dev.<br>Optimized for 144 FPS with crisp visuals and low file size.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/f15d3726e1262f1079302c30f9007794.avif?t=1787305316\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras_big/f15d3726e1262f1079302c30f9007794.webp?t=1787305316 width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to the BAIONLENJA Corporation.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BAIONLENJA: First-Person Adventure that focuses on Source-Engine Inspired Movement Physics.</strong> <br><br>B-HOP and <span class=\"bb_strike\">rocket</span> BLADE JUMP<br>The oldest movement exploits in FPS history are refined and polished to become your weapons. <br>Let's see an enemy survive a blade hit while you're going at MACH 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/14921cf9574c967f0b0ac1ab91627766.poster.avif?t=1787305316\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/14921cf9574c967f0b0ac1ab91627766.webm?t=1787305316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/14921cf9574c967f0b0ac1ab91627766.mp4?t=1787305316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Movement so powerful it looks like cheating, but it takes skill to master</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">New to Source-Engine movement?  <br>No problem, the game will guide you to become a movement pro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/27e6b025a1ed16f7abb831e9b606817d.poster.avif?t=1787305316\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/27e6b025a1ed16f7abb831e9b606817d.webm?t=1787305316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/27e6b025a1ed16f7abb831e9b606817d.mp4?t=1787305316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Deepest Lore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are SPIRIT: a being awakened by the god-like fossil creature GEHIRN who grants you physics-defying abilities and guides you towards an unknown purpose. <br>Enter the BAIONLENJA Corporation research facility where the fossil is being studied, and learn the truth of your origin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/e6b694765bf1ecf30b6a6c4fa0890132.poster.avif?t=1787305316\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/e6b694765bf1ecf30b6a6c4fa0890132.webm?t=1787305316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/